/*
 * psl.js - "who owns this site?" for Term Sherpa, using a FIXED, bundled copy of the Public Suffix List (core/psl-data.js).
 * Pure functions: no network, no storage, no runtime download. The list is regenerated by scripts/gen-psl.js and committed.
 *
 * registrableDomain("www.bbc.co.uk") -> "bbc.co.uk";  registrableDomain("a.github.io") -> "a.github.io" (github.io is a
 * private suffix, so a.github.io and b.github.io are different owners);  registrableDomain("co.uk") -> null (a bare suffix).
 * sameOwner(a, b)              true when both hosts share a registrable domain.
 * isKnownPolicyService(host)   true for hosts of the common policy-hosting services (and their subdomains).
 * unrelatedPolicyHost(pageHost, finalHost)
 *                              true when a policy read from finalHost belongs to a different owner than the page it was
 *                              linked from AND finalHost is not a known policy service. Used for the "hosted on an
 *                              unrelated site" finding (a finding, never a block).
 */
